{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "数字 2 和 3 分别映射到字母集合 abc 与 def，问题可以看成从每一列依次选择一个字母。动画用深度优先搜索展示“选择、继续、记录、撤销”的循环，每到第二层就得到一个完整组合。两层共有 3 × 3 = 9 条路径，因此最终得到 9 个答案。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>电话号码的字母组合</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}.section{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px}.section:last-child{margin-bottom:0}h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}h2{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}.mono,.key,.letter,.result,.path{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.input{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.key{min-width:48px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px}.key small{display:block;margin-top:4px;color:#9cdcfe;font-size:10px}.columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}.column{padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px}.column-label{margin-bottom:6px;color:#9cdcfe;font-size:10px}.letters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.letter{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;transition:.25s}.letter.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.status{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}.card{padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px}.card-label{margin-bottom:4px;color:#9cdcfe;font-size:10px}.path{font-size:13px;color:#d4d4d4;font-weight:600}.action{font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}.results{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}.result{padding:2px 7px;text-align:center;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:11px;transition:.25s}.result.done{color:#d4d4d4}.result.latest{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.rule{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#252526;font-size:12px}@media(max-width:520px){.columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"section\">\n<h1>示例：digits = <span class=\"mono\">\"23\"</span></h1>\n<div class=\"input\">\n<div class=\"key\">2<small>a · b · c</small></div>\n<div class=\"key\">3<small>d · e · f</small></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section\">\n<h2>逐层选择：每个位置选一个字母</h2>\n<div class=\"columns\">\n<div class=\"column\"><div class=\"column-label\">位置 0 · 数字 2</div><div class=\"letters\" id=\"left\"><div class=\"letter\">a</div><div class=\"letter\">b</div><div class=\"letter\">c</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"column\"><div class=\"column-label\">位置 1 · 数字 3</div><div class=\"letters\" id=\"right\"><div class=\"letter\">d</div><div class=\"letter\">e</div><div class=\"letter\">f</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"status\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">当前路径</div><div class=\"path\" id=\"path\">—</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">当前动作</div><div class=\"action\" id=\"action\">从第一个数字开始搜索</div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section\">\n<h2>已记录的完整组合</h2>\n<div class=\"results\" id=\"results\"><div class=\"result\">ad</div><div class=\"result\">ae</div><div class=\"result\">af</div><div class=\"result\">bd</div><div class=\"result\">be</div><div class=\"result\">bf</div><div class=\"result\">cd</div><div class=\"result\">ce</div><div class=\"result\">cf</div></div>\n<div class=\"rule\">路径长度等于数字个数 2 时记录答案, 然后撤销选择. 一般 n 个数字最多 4ⁿ 个组合; 含复制结果的时间 O(n·4ⁿ), 递归辅助空间 O(n). 空输入返回空列表.</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst digits='23', mapping={2:'abc',3:'def'}, frames=[], chosen=[], answers=[];\nfunction save(action){frames.push({path:chosen.join(''),answers:[...answers],action})}\nsave('路径为空, 从第 0 个数字开始.');\nfunction dfs(depth){\n if(depth===digits.length){answers.push(chosen.join(''));save('到达末尾, 记录 '+chosen.join('')+'.');return}\n for(const ch of mapping[digits[depth]]){\n  chosen.push(ch);save('位置 '+depth+' 选择 '+ch+', 进入下一层.');\n  dfs(depth+1);\n  chosen.pop();save('撤销位置 '+depth+' 的 '+ch+', 恢复上一层路径.');\n }\n}\ndfs(0);save('全部分支已枚举, 得到 9 个组合.');\nconst left=[...document.querySelectorAll('#left .letter')],right=[...document.querySelectorAll('#right .letter')],results=[...document.querySelectorAll('#results .result')];\nlet step=0;\nfunction render(){const f=frames[step];\n left.forEach((x,i)=>x.classList.toggle('active','abc'[i]===f.path[0]));\n right.forEach((x,i)=>x.classList.toggle('active','def'[i]===f.path[1]));\n results.forEach((x,i)=>{x.textContent=i<f.answers.length?f.answers[i]:'—';x.classList.toggle('done',i<f.answers.length);x.classList.toggle('latest',i===f.answers.length-1)});\n document.getElementById('path').textContent=f.path||'—';\n document.getElementById('action').textContent='步骤 '+(step+1)+' / '+frames.length+': '+f.action;\n step=(step+1)%frames.length;\n}\nrender();setInterval(render,1500);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(n·4^n)",
  "space_complexity": "O(n)",
  "complexity_note": "n 是输入数字个数. 每位最多 4 个字母, 最坏 4^n 个组合, 每个组合转为字符串需 O(n); 可变字符路径和递归栈 O(n). 不含 O(n·4^n) 的输出, 空输入返回空列表."
}
